Subject: [PATCH 0017] Borderless windowed display mode

video.display_mode = window | borderless | fullscreen (Settings::borderless
beside Settings::fullscreen; settings::display_mode/set_display_mode).
Borderless: a window with no frame over the whole display it is on, kept
there when it moves to another display or the desktop's resolution changes;
the plain window's place and size come back when leaving it. video.fullscreen
is still read first and written, so older builds see borderless as a window.
VulkanRenderer::set_display_mode; set_fullscreen remains. The menu's Display
row cycles the three.

